{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41582","headline":"金陵杂题二首 二 · 沈彬","name":"金陵杂题二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮潮声落草光沉，贾客来帆宿岸阴。\n一笛月明何处酒，满城秋色几家砧。\n时清曾恶桓温盛，山翠长牵谢傅心。\n今日到来何物在，碧烟和雨锁寒林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}